#: scripts/main.gd:964
msgid "Chrome Jackal bewacht den Ausgang. Ich kann seine Implantate stören. Du kümmerst dich um den Rest."
msgstr "Chrome Jackal is guarding the exit. I can disrupt his implants. You take care of the rest."

#: scripts/main.gd:965
