msgstr "Agreed. First we need a way past the lock."

#: scripts/main.gd:966
msgid "Das Terminal rechts. Danach %s für meinen Hack. Wenn er rot ausholt: ausweichen!"
msgstr "The terminal on the right. Then %s for my hack. When he winds up in red: dodge!"

#: scripts/main.gd:977
