msgstr "The data's secured. Maybe it'll lead us to the Minotaurus mechs."

#: scripts/main.gd:982
msgid "Dann verschwinden wir. Und vergiss nicht: Wir sind noch lange keine Freunde."
msgstr "Then let's get out of here. And remember: we're still a long way from being friends."

