#: scripts/aerodyne_flight.gd:423
msgid "RAVEN: Scanner! Richtung drücken, sobald der Strahl auf uns liegt."
msgstr "RAVEN: Scanner! Press the direction as soon as the beam hits us."

#: scripts/aerodyne_flight.gd:462
